  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-09T19:31:57.680893Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-09T19:41:23.403919Z",
  "totalBlocks": 26,
  "translatedBlocks": 26,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6713844dd48eea15",
      "translationZh": "在防御者窗口缩小时保持领先",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abb7bf1cd33a0e4c",
      "translationZh": "前沿人工智能正在从两个方向改变网络安全。先进模型可以帮助防御者更快地发现和调查威胁。但这些能力也正在向开源权重模型扩散，为攻击者提供了发现漏洞和加速利用的新途径。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a39c36a453c56a4d",
      "translationZh": "Sophos（在新窗口打开）是阻止这些攻击的公司之一，已为跨行业和地区的超过62.5万家组织提供保护。公司首席技术官约翰·彼得森表示：“我们看到各种各样的攻击。”他说：“我们在网络安全业务中已有四十年的经验，积累了丰富的防御专业知识。”",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2728a7886a7cf39d",
      "translationZh": "通过 OpenAI Daybreak，Sophos 将 OpenAI 模型与其自身的威胁情报、响应剧本和安全专长相结合。其目标并非仅仅为分析员提供另一种工具，而是提升 Sophos 在所有受保护客户中的专业影响力。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d850f15b1404fc1",
      "translationZh": "Sophos 带来了领域专长和规模化对抗攻击的技术。Daybreak 等项目以及 OpenAI 等公司提供的前沿情报，使我们能够将这种领域专长扩展，以支持所有客户。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ef6272d493fee6d",
      "translationZh": "—约翰·彼得森，首席技术官，Sophos",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cb5b36ba27df5d0",
      "translationZh": "工作的核心是 Sophos Fusion，这是一个包含 Sophos Managed Detection and Response（MDR）的 Sophos AI 原生网络防御系统。它将来自超过 500 个第三方集成的传感器数据以及 Sophos 自身产品的数据汇集在一起。这些传感器每天共同产生万亿级事件，Sophos 将其提炼为大约 1,000 到 2,000 起案件，供其九个安全运营中心进行调查。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d74383d61cd4ed26",
      "translationZh": "通过 Daybreak 构建的代理改变了这些案件的处理方式。调查代理会为每个案件收集客户上下文、检测结果、指标（IoCs）以及相关威胁情报。随后，规划模型会创建一个计划–执行–审查循环：制定调查计划、完成步骤并生成包含建议响应措施的摘要，供分析师审查。其他代理可以执行响应的部分内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1696113da6aca442",
      "translationZh": "在 Daybreak 出现之前，案件的调查和响应主要依赖于人工专业知识。Sophos 的现有流程平均约为 38 分钟 — — Peterson 表示这一表现优于 96% 的专业安全运营中心。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b50ecb59a958117",
      "translationZh": "现在，因为我们能够通过 Daybreak 计划构建这些代理，使用这些代理处理案件的平均响应时间已降至约 89 秒。我们处理的约一半案件现在正由我们使用 Daybreak 模型开发的代理实现自动化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6ecc051178ec420d",
      "translationZh": "将判断置于核心",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06a3202fbbb2515a",
      "translationZh": "Sophos 通过三种运营模式将客户控制融入其 MDR 服务中：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96c84d635c33e626",
      "translationZh": "通知：Sophos 调查案件并推荐响应措施，但由客户执行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d8c592334a8f50d",
      "translationZh": "协作：Sophos 与客户在采取行动前共同工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "badbbd32878cc1a5",
      "translationZh": "授权：Sophos 可以直接代表客户进行响应。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93b5c1e23e2ab060",
      "translationZh": "无论工作是由人还是由代理完成，相同的边界都适用。Sophos 利用自动化快速行动，并更好地利用分析师的时间，但潜在破坏性的操作仍然需要适当的人工监督。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49d2088cb4caf078",
      "translationZh": "“我们不放心让代理处理的任何事情都会被移交给人工判断，” Peterson 确认。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d7ad06e5e3a3518",
      "translationZh": "使用代理处理的案例平均响应时间从大约 38 分钟降低到 89 秒。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d57c4bd1d734f6ff",
      "translationZh": "使 Sophos 能够在 Sophos 分析师校准的边界内，利用 AI 端到端解决 52% 的 MDR 案例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d06057b197c0a264",
      "translationZh": "为客户提供更快速且更一致的调查体验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ec1620be3009115",
      "translationZh": "帮助 Sophos 扩展计算资源，而不是依赖于稀缺网络安全人员人数的等比增长。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "533d99f85e1365d1",
      "translationZh": "将分析师的注意力集中在他们专业知识最为关键的威胁、例外和决策上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ed69c9efae960f2",
      "translationZh": "Peterson 说 Sophos 将继续扩展其代理能够做的事情。“响应能力将继续变得更加复杂，我们将扩大我们用已构建的代理所处理的用例范围。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05a9e976dc1f55de",
      "translationZh": "_“像 Daybreak 这样的项目，我们有机会领先于攻击者社区一步。”_",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26222e8718536324",
      "translationZh": "他对其他安全领导者的建议很简单：“安全领导者明天应该做的唯一事情就是真正回到关注他们组织的安全基础上，”他说。“这当然包括补丁。但补丁只会包含供应商已知的漏洞。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0252f1b5d1d942d",
      "translationZh": "答案是要保持“分层安全方法”，其中包括端点保护、多因素身份验证（MFA）、网络分割和强大的安全运营。“漏洞正以惊人的速度被发现，并在前所未见的规模上被利用。因此我认为，做好基础工作今天比以往任何时候都更重要。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
